  {
    "RowOffset": 719954,
    "RowId": 39199,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 719966,
    "RowId": 39200,
    "Text": "Defeat Gulool Ja Ja's glory!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 720006,
    "RowId": 39201,
    "Text": "Bear witness to our resolve!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 720046,
    "RowId": 39202,
    "Text": "So long as we stand together, we're unstoppable!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 720106,
    "RowId": 39203,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 720118,
    "RowId": 39204,
    "Text": "Some manner of paralyzing effect─defend the afflicted!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 720186,
    "RowId": 39205,
    "Text": "None can outrun my flames."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 720226,
    "RowId": 39206,
    "Text": "Blades of fire rain."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 720258,
    "RowId": 39207,
    "Text": "I know not who you are, but I applaud your tenacity."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 720322,
    "RowId": 39208,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 720334,
    "RowId": 39209,
    "Text": "Not enough... But together, we shall triumph!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 720390,
    "RowId": 39210,
    "Text": "Resolve and Reason kindle..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 720430,
    "RowId": 39211,
    "Text": "Everyone, get behind me! I've got a bad feeling about this..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 720502,
    "RowId": 39212,
    "Text": "Will you have the strength to stand after this?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 720562,
    "RowId": 39213,
    "Text": "I will be the next Dawnservant...I will protect my people!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 720634,
    "RowId": 39214,
    "Text": "Hehehe... Is that the best you can do?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 720686,
    "RowId": 39215,
    "Text": "Impressive─but I'm not finished yet!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 720738,
    "RowId": 39216,
    "Text": "We will see Lamaty'i become Dawnservant. For Tuliyollal!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 720806,
    "RowId": 39217,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 720818,
    "RowId": 39218,
    "Text": ""
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 720830,
    "RowId": 39219,
    "Text": "Surely you can handle this much?"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 720874,
    "RowId": 39220,
    "Text": "Surely this will quench your thirst for battle."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 720934,
    "RowId": 39221,
    "Text": "By crimson wrath be sundered!"
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 720974,
    "RowId": 39222,
    "Text": "<split(<String>ObjectParameter(1)</String>, ,1)>! No... This can't be happening..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 721038,
    "RowId": 39223,
    "Text": "And the reason which guides our journey..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 721094,
    "RowId": 39224,
    "Text": "Ever hungry for battle..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 721130,
    "RowId": 39225,
    "Text": "5 seconds to Saga of Dawn and Duty..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 721178,
    "RowId": 39226,
    "Text": "4 seconds to Saga of Dawn and Duty..."
  },
  {
    "RowOffset": 721226,
    "RowId": 39227,
